 "name_en": "Handling Unit Management (4MM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Handling Unit Management (4MM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A handling unit is a physical unit consisting of packaging materials (load carriers or packing material) and the goods contained on or in it. A handling unit is always a combination of products and packaging materials. All the information contained in the product items (for example, about batches) is retained in the handling units and is always available.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item sets up packaging of materials in outbound, inbound, inventory and production, including batches and serial numbers. Because it only includes the steps for packaging, it requires a standard process scope item to work with.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute packing manually in Outbound Delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute packing automatically in Outbound Delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage handling units in inventory</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute packing manually in Inbound Delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute packing automatically in Inbound Delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan and create handling units in discrete and process manufacturing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm handling units in production (discrete and process)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Intracompany</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Intercompany Stock Transfer</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Intercompany Stock Transfer Return</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Customer Consignment</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use a unique identifier across all locations (such as GTL, SSCC, or other number formats)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print labels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reflect packing-based logistic structures across logistic unit levels – such as production and distribution, across plants, or across a plant and customer (Outbound)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track movements of packed goods in logistics easily</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>处理单元管理 (4MM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">处理单元是一个物理单元，由包装物料（载具或包装材料）及其包含的货物组成。处理单元始终是产品和包装物料的组合。产品项目中包含的所有信息（例如，关于批次）都保留在处理单元中，并且始终可用。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目设置出库、入库、库存和生产中的物料包装，包括批次和序列号。由于它仅包含包装步骤，因此需要使用标准流程范围项目。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在出库交货中手动执行包装</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在出库交货中自动执行包装</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理库存中的处理单元</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在入库交货中手动执行包装</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在入库交货中自动执行包装</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在离散制造和流程制造中计划和创建处理单元。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认生产中的处理单元（离散和流程）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行公司内</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行公司间库存转储</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行公司间库存转储退货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行客户寄售</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0cf898199d3b48a8bc896432b837bcd6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在所有位置使用唯一标识符（例如 GTL、SSCC 或其他数字格式）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印标签</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">反映物流单元级别（如生产和分销）、工厂间或工厂和客户之间的基于包装的物流结构（出库）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松跟踪物流中包装货物的移动</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
